tool.vanishing_point.name = Ntlha ea ho Nyamela
tool.vanishing_point.description = Hula ho etsa bokaholimo bo bataletseng holim'a ntho e nang le ponahalo ea botebo, ebe u fetola mokhoa hore e be Kopitsa 'me u pente: lipiksele tse kopilitsoeng li latela bokaholimo boo, li ntse li fokotseha ha sebaka se eketseha.
